 946		Then the collection $\{ T^{\line_\xpt,\line_\zpt}_{f_\xpt,f_\zpt} \}$ forms a valid POVM. Moreover, by the fact that $\{\hat{M}^{(\Line, W), \line_W}_{f_W}\}$ comes from a valid strategy for the low-degree test, it holds that $f_W \in \deg_{d}(\line_W)$ whenver $\line_W$ is axis-parallel, and thus property holds for $T$ as well. 
